        "sort": 300000,
        "system": {
          "description": "",
          "history": "<p>The Brute of weapons. Violent and stupid, its horrific legacy is impossible to ignore. Massive, blunt objects used to crush bones and pulverize the foe; they are exceedingly easy to use, able to rely on both size and momentum.</p><p>Uncomplicated and uncompromising, this weapon adds +2d10 Damage to every successful attack you land. Magic is not needed to enjoy this benefit; it is provided by the physics of the weapon. You may add an additional +10 damage for the cost of 3 Prana, but this power must be imbued prior to launching your attack.</p>",
          "tag1": "Heavy",
